From e84af8907331d3ee57dd8170920c620b7d642abb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Juuso Alasuutari <juuso.alasuutari@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:53:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] capture: write versioned metadata and complete batches
 atomically

This commit makes the capture writer record per-frame metadata with a
version, hash frames only for equality, and publish a finished batch
with a hard link and a rename. Before this commit, a reader could see a
partial manifest, and the writer emptied its directory in place.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
